Build the F1TENTH simulator with colcon, and scan at the lidar's rate.

- gym: a version specifier that newer setuptools rejects.
- f1tenth_gym: list its packages, so a regular (non-editable) install,
  which is what colcon does, contains f110_gym.
- f1tenth_gym_ros: optional scan_range_min, scan_range_max, scan_rate_hz
  and odom_tf_rate_hz. The defaults keep upstream's behaviour, 1080-beam
  scans at 250 Hz; rc_sim sets the UST-10LX's 40 Hz and 10 m, and odometry
  at the 100 Hz physics step.

Upstream: https://github.com/openai/gym at 0.19.0
          https://github.com/f1tenth/f1tenth_gym at 4fdb9c7
          https://github.com/f1tenth/f1tenth_gym_ros at 883394d
License:  MIT, as all three

